            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"week-1-your-first-chart-and-what-the-human-is-for\">Week 1 \u2014 Your first chart, and what the human is for</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Tonight you make <strong>one chart from one CMS file</strong>, publish it as a link a classmate can open,\nand write down <strong>the question you want your aggregator to answer</strong> this term.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">You do not need to write code. Pick options with the controls below. When you want something\nthe notebook doesn't do yet, use an <strong>Ask your AI</strong> box: copy the prompt into the AI tool of your\nchoice, paste its code into a new cell, and then check its answer against the numbers on screen.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><em>Data rule from day one: only public, aggregate data goes into any AI tool. No patient data,\nno passwords.</em></span></span>"
