            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"publish-it-as-a-link\">Publish it as a link</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Your deliverable is a link a classmate can open and see your chart \u2014 without installing anything.</span>\n<ol>\n<li>Open this notebook in <strong>molab</strong> (marimo's free hosted notebooks) if you aren't already there.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Save a copy</strong> (or <strong>Fork</strong> on the preview page) so the notebook is in your own workspace.\n   A notebook you only ran with <strong>Run it now</strong> isn't saved, so it can't be shared.</li>\n<li>In your copy, set the dropdowns to the view you want to show.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Share</strong>, then <strong>Copy App URL</strong>. That's the notebook as an app, with the code hidden.</li>\n<li><strong>Test the link</strong> in a private/incognito browser window, or send it to a classmate and ask what they see.\n   If they can't open it, it isn't shared yet. If it opens with different dropdown settings from yours,\n   add a line to your submission naming the settings to pick.</li>\n</ol></span>"
